~ start
do Global.dim_lights(true)
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.narrator, true)
Narrator: The lions were very clever and taught the mouse everything
Narrator: Like how to cook, and clean the house
Narrator: The mouse liked cooking and cleaning to show the lions just how thankful they were
do Global.control_spotlight_async(Global.stage.narrator, false)
do Global.dim_lights_async(false)
